<title>POLAND: Poligrafia 1996 net rises to PLN 2.3 mln.</title>
<headline>Poligrafia 1996 net rises to PLN 2.3 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poligrafia SA results for the year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						 1996	   1995</p>
<p>    operating profit		     5.11   vs    3.35</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			 4.11   vs    1.41</p>
<p>    net profit			     2.26   vs    0.78</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Poligrafia SA.</p>
<p>    net sales			     36.23   vs   24.49</p>
<p>    costs of sales			28.09   vs   19.32</p>
<p>    extraordinary			  0.00   vs    0.00</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>    income tax			     1.85   vs    0.63</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   0.13   vs    0.03</p>
<p>    financial costs			1.13   vs    1.96</p>
<p>    investment			    21.27   vs    0.99</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
